# *.png
# Covers data/server-state.json (per-guild bot state, see ServerStateStore in
# index.js) — it must stay untracked so deploys never overwrite it. package.json
# and package-lock.json remain tracked because they were committed before this
# rule existed; git never untracks files retroactively. Any new JSON file that
# does belong in the repo needs `git add -f`.
*.json